{"t":"Speed Set","s":"speed-set-e7c42","k":"outro","i":"assets/wiki/Shrunken_Head_Necklace_70dfa7.gif","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><table><tbody><tr>\n<td valign=\"top\">\n<p>The <strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Speed Set</strong> consists of all Items that increases your speed. None of the vocations can wear all best items of this set. The best equipment for each slot are:\n</p><p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Shrunken Head Necklace\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Shrunken_Head_Necklace_70dfa7.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span> The Shrunken Head Necklace comes from <a href=\"#/wiki/The%20Welter\">The Welter</a>.<br/>\n<i>It can only be wielded properly by players of level 150 or higher.<br/>It increases movement by 10 speed points.</i>\n</p><p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Tiara of Power\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Tiara_of_Power_b9903e.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span> The Tiara of Power is dropped by creatures from the <a href=\"#/wiki/Otherworld\">Otherworld</a>.<br/>\n<i>It can only be wielded properly by sorcerers and druids of level 100 or higher.<br/> It increases movement by 20 speed points for 60 minutes.</i>\n</p><p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Prismatic Armor\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Prismatic_Armor_a2cf28.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span> The Prismatic Armor obtainable by exchanging <a href=\"#/wiki/Major%20Crystalline%20Token\">Major Crystalline Tokens</a><br/>\n<i>It can only be wielded properly by knights and paladins of level 120 or higher.<br/>It increases movement by 15 speed points.</i>\n</p><p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Grasshopper Legs\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Grasshopper_Legs_b04234.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span> The Grasshopper Legs can be looted by <a href=\"#/wiki/Waspoid\">Waspoids</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Crawler\">Crawlers</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Spitter\">Spitters</a>.<br/>\n<i>It can only be wielded properly by players of level 75 or higher.<br/>It increases movement by 10 speed points.</i>\n</p><p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Sparking Rainbow Shield\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Sparking_Rainbow_Shield_3760b8.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span> The Sparking Rainbow Shield is gotten by enchanting a Rainbow Shield with energy. (The Rainbow Shield is obtainable through The <a href=\"#/wiki/The%20Demon%20Oak%20Quest\">Demon Oak Quest</a>.)<br/>\n<i>It can only be wielded properly by knights of level 100 or higher.<br/>It increases movement by 10 speed points.</i>\n</p><p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Time Ring\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Time_Ring_8a8c16.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span> The <a href=\"#/wiki/Time%20Ring\">Time Ring</a> come from <a href=\"#/wiki/Adept%20of%20the%20Cult\">Adept of the Cult</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Crystal%20Spider\">Crystal Spider</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Giant%20Spider\">Giant Spider</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Tarantula\">Tarantula</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Thalas\">Thalas</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/The%20Old%20Widow\">The Old Widow</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Werewolf\">Werewolf</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Hide\">Hide</a><br/>\nIs is also obtained from <a href=\"#/quest/time-ring-quest\">Time Ring Quest</a>, <a href=\"#/quest/ornamented-shield-quest\">Ornamented Shield Quest</a> and <a href=\"#/quest/ring-quest\">Ring Quest</a>.<i><br/>It increases movement by 30 speed points for 10 minutes.</i>\n</p><p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Void Boots\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Void_Boots_c95f47.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span> The Void Boots is dropped by creatures from the <a href=\"#/wiki/Otherworld\">Otherworld</a>.<br/>\n<i>It can only be wielded properly by players of level 150 or higher.<br/>It increases movement by 30 speed points for 60 minutes.</i>\n</p><p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Filled Jalapeno Peppers\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Filled_Jalapeno_Peppers_a04183.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span> Consuming a Filled Jalapeño Peppers <br/><i>It increases movement by 200 speed points for 60 minutes.</i>\n</p><p><a href=\"#/wiki/Imbuing\">Imbuing</a> your <a href=\"#/wiki/Boots\">Boots</a> with basic Swiftness <br/><i>It increases movement by 10 speed points</i>\n</p><p>Imbuing your Boots with intricate Swiftness <br/><i>It increases movement by 15 speed points</i>\n</p><p>Imbuing your Boots with <a href=\"#/wiki/Powerful%20Swiftness\">powerful</a> Swiftness <br/><i>It increases movement by 30 speed points</i>\n</p><p>See also Speed and other Sets.\n</p>\n</td>\n<td valign=\"top\">\n<div class=\"equips_set_basic\">\n<div style=\"left:1px;top:19px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Shrunken Head Necklace\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Shrunken_Head_Necklace_70dfa7.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></div>\n<div style=\"left:1px;top:55px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"NoWeaponRight\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/NoWeaponRight_cbfbe3.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></div>\n<div style=\"left:1px;top:91px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Time%20Ring\"><img alt=\"Time Ring\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Time_Ring_8a8c16.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></div>\n<div style=\"left:37px;top:1px;\">\n<span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Werewolf Helmet\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Werewolf_Helmet_ba54c8.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></div>\n<div style=\"left:37px;top:37px;\">\n<span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Prismatic Armor\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Prismatic_Armor_a2cf28.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></div>\n<div style=\"left:37px;top:73px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Grasshopper Legs\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Grasshopper_Legs_b04234.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></div>\n<div style=\"left:37px;top:109px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Void Boots\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Void_Boots_c95f47.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span>\n</div>\n<div style=\"left:73px;top:19px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"NoBag\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/NoBag_a37099.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></div>\n<div style=\"left:73px;top:55px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Sparking Rainbow Shield\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Sparking_Rainbow_Shield_3760b8.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></div>\n<div style=\"left:73px;top:91px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Filled Jalapeño Peppers\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Filled_Jalapeno_Peppers_a04183.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></div>\n</div><small><i></i></small>\n<p>Knights\n</p><p><br/>\n</p>\n<div class=\"equips_set_basic\">\n<div style=\"left:1px;top:19px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Shrunken Head Necklace\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Shrunken_Head_Necklace_70dfa7.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></div>\n<div style=\"left:1px;top:55px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"NoWeaponRight\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/NoWeaponRight_cbfbe3.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></div>\n<div style=\"left:1px;top:91px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Time%20Ring\"><img alt=\"Time Ring\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Time_Ring_8a8c16.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></div>\n<div style=\"left:37px;top:1px;\">\n<span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Tiara of Power\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Tiara_of_Power_b9903e.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></div>\n<div style=\"left:37px;top:37px;\">\n<span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Swan%20Feather%20Cloak\"><img alt=\"Swan Feather Cloak\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Swan_Feather_Cloak_bf9753.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></div>\n<div style=\"left:37px;top:73px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Grasshopper Legs\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Grasshopper_Legs_b04234.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></div>\n<div style=\"left:37px;top:109px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Void Boots\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Void_Boots_c95f47.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span>\n</div>\n<div style=\"left:73px;top:19px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"NoBag\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/NoBag_a37099.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></div>\n<div style=\"left:73px;top:55px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"NoWeaponLeft\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/NoWeaponLeft_3762fd.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></div>